		/*
		JRO 3/8/2023  For 11540 Network Stack logic
		We need [wf_ib_2170_nsa] to run last (afater all other section update iiiput, but logging only is OK to happen above).  
		In order to do this we had to move the [wf_ib_2170_nsa] @nsaAction = 2 from above to here
		If the claim is NOT in the network stack, run as normal
		if the claim IS in the network stack, and we know what @QPA_repricing_claim_history_id to update iiiput with, run with [wf_ib_2170_nsa] @nsaAction = 2
		*/
		
		if @add_to_qpa_list = 1
		begin
